WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.200
Microsoft Learn's Graph
pages give three calls.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.889
Post to create a rule, which needs read-write
custom detection and the Detection

3
00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:11.087
tuning manage permission,
or Security Administrator;

4
00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:14.000
the quota is ten creates
a minute per application.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.837
Get to list the rules,
with the read permission.

6
00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:21.137
And patch to update one, supplying
only the properties that change.

7
00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:24.988
A rule has a query, a schedule,
a status of enabled or disabled,

8
00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:27.974
and a detection action
with an alert template,

9
00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:31.825
and optionally automated
actions, like isolating devices.

10
00:00:31.825 --> 00:00:35.415
None of these pages has
a national-cloud table,

11
00:00:35.415 --> 00:00:39.288
so the API's GCC availability
is not yet specified.

12
00:00:39.288 --> 00:00:43.010
The guide's interim path is
the portal, from the same file.
